<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Zul</book>
  <para style="h">GAL</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galatiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tǝlankur kǝ Bulus dǝ mǝn Galatiya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tǝlankur kǝ Bulus dǝ mǝn kopi Yesu kǝ Galatiya</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Tǝlankur kǝn ɗǝl ni karǝm ami Bulus nye mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesu. A dǝm ni nye mǝn kartǝni tǝp kar Yesu Almasihu na Bǝba Yami, muntu kan tli Yesuyi gip mǝshi mbarǝm gwa, ba'e mbarǝm jen ni ko murgon ni la'ǝm bi da'a. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Ami na ɓyar mǝn kopi kup kan ra namǝn ɗe gwani ba kar bar na tǝlankur kǝn dǝ mǝn kopi ju kan ra gip atl kǝ Galatiya gwa. <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Naa dǝ zo mbatl na dǝmi zhǝlili kǝ Ba gǝmi Yam na Babom Yesu Almasihu dǝm nan kǝne. <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Yesu bi gam gǝs den bi kǝ nge kopi Yam gǝmika, kǝ dǝ tǝ ɗǝli mi bi dǝ zhan kǝn mǝn ɗasi tu'e. Tǝ pii ni untu domici untu ni Ba gǝmi Yam ba ndu ar pi. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Ɗǝɗatǝn kupo gwas ni ar dǝm ba patǝni. Ar dǝm untu.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba kǝ kop ni zo shirǝm kǝ lar da'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Dli gǝn iɗaka nan na zhotǝn untu kǝn den za'i muntu la kǝn bi gip zo mbatl kǝ Almasihu gwa. Kǝn den kopi zut zo shirǝm goni, <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />ama zut zo shirǝm gon ra da'a. A yari ni untu domici jen ra kan den ndu'i wu tli in mbatl gwa, wu den ndu'i'e wu guzǝl zo shirǝm kǝ Almasihu kan ar ni'e ge shirǝmi gwa. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Ama ko ma mǝn ni ko mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam gon kan ɗǝl sur yam ni pi in wazu kǝ zo shirǝm gon bom na muntu mǝ pi ino, naa dǝ bi nǝm ti! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Kandatu mǝ tare mǝ yari ino, ar ni a pa yari in kǝkǝn'e kup muntu kan baa pi in wazu kǝ zo shirǝm gon bom na muntu kan kǝ tare kǝ nǝmo, naa dǝ bi nǝm ti!<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Ko baa wule gip shirǝm tuwo, kǝ shin ami ni den ndu'i a zam cirtǝn kar mbarǝma ko a zam cirtǝn kar Yami? Ko ami ni den ndu'i a iɗa'i mbarǝm mbatl katl? Dǝ wule har kǝkǝn ami ni den ndu'i a iɗa'i mbarǝm mbatlo, ona a dǝm zher kǝ Almasihu da'a.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kandatu Bulus dǝm nye mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesu gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Mir ɓyari, a ndu ni kǝ mom'e, zo shirǝm mǝn tǝmtǝn tu a pi in wazu gǝso, tǝp kar mbarǝm ni ar ɗǝl da'a. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Kar mbarǝm ni a nǝm shirǝmi da'a. Murgon ni es kulcim da'a. Yesu Almasihu na gam gǝs ni ɓulim momi muntu.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Kǝ kum kanda kǝ dǝmi gǝn nan a'i gip kopi pitǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda gwa. A kumi dli mǝn kopi Yam naar har ma a ngen a pa'ika nan wuri. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Ami den ci cina gip kopi pitǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda ar man mǝn Yahuda ju sǝr gǝn ni gwa. Ami ra den kopi tloyi shirǝm kǝ ga ba gǝn asǝm na gǝse. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Ama Yam ni zǝzarǝm kan ba nem markǝmi kapǝn dǝ gǝrǝmi. Ti la'ǝm ni bi tǝp kǝba zo mbatl gǝsi. <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />Nan ar tǝmi ti biwo, tǝ kemǝn a mom nya gǝs Yesu, kǝ dǝ a pi wazu kǝ zo shirǝm dǝ munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da gwa. Den kaar kǝ untuwo, a ngen shirǝm den argon kar murgon da'a. <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />A su Urushalima kar munju kan dǝm mir mǝn kartǝn cina da'ǝm gwa da'a. Argon tu a piwo ar ni'e, a ndara atl tu kan ba la ti bi'e Arabiya gwa, den kariwo kan a pal gip bǝn kǝ Dimashka.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Den kaar kǝ sheti ghon myakano, kan a ndara Urushalima kǝ dǝ a shin Kepas, Siman Bitǝrus ituwi. A pi muri kutl cet nantam kar ti. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Den kaar kǝ untuwo, a shin ko nǝm gip mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesu da'a, se de Yakubu erǝm kǝ Babomi. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Bar tu a rǝshi ino ge shirǝm ni, cina dǝ Yam ni a yari ine, lar ni a cen da'a.<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Den kariwo, arni a ndara atl kǝ Siriya na kǝ Kilikiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Ama mǝn kopi Almasihu nan ra gip atl kǝ Yahudawo, wu momǝn den ger da'a. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Wu kum ni katl'e, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm tu kan ba kumi mi dli far, kan ndu tǝ pa'ika na ngeshtǝn den Yesu kupo, ti ni kǝkǝn den kulci mbarǝm den wu ngesh wur den Yesu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Arni wu ɗǝɗa Yam den argon tu tǝ pi tǝp karǝm gwa.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Mir mǝn kartǝni kop kaar kǝ zo shirǝm tu Bulus yari gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Den kaar kǝ sheti ghon kutl cet wupsewo, arni a pa pal su Urushalimaka ami na Barnaba, a ndara na Titus pa'e. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />A su ni Urushalima domici Yam ni godem'e a su. Nan a mbubaro, ar ni a mo na kiri mǝn cina kǝ mǝn kopi wi nan gǝzǝni, kan a yari wur kandatu a pi wazu zo shirǝm tu dǝ munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da gwa. A pi ni untu bǝse dǝ mbap tu ami den piwo ar dǝmka kǝ katl. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Ama ko Titus kan ra namǝn ma, kup na ti mǝn Hellas ni, ama murgon kem'e dǝ sǝr ti da'a. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Shirǝm kǝ sǝrtǝn tu tli ni nan mǝn kopi kǝ lar ju kan ter na ghuuni gipi gwa. Wu ter ni gipi kǝdǝ wu li zami gam tu kan mǝn ra nari tǝp kar Almasihu Yesu gwa. Wu ndu ni'e wu pali mi ka zheri, <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />ama mǝ kopi wur da'a ko njem, kǝdǝ ge shirǝm kǝ zo shirǝmi ci cina na dǝmi gip kǝne.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Mbarǝm ju kan pǝn wur den wi kirino, wu ɓit argon ra den kulci tu ami den pi gwa da'a. (Gip shini gǝno ko unu badǝr mbarǝm ni'e wi, kup nǝm ni karǝmi, domici Yamo tǝ ndu murgon man gon da'a). <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Ama wu shin kandatu Yam bim pi mbap wazu kǝ zo shirǝm tu dǝ munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa, kandatu tǝ bi Bitǝrus mbap wazu kǝ zo shirǝm tu dǝ munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni gwa. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Yam pi mbap tǝp kar Bitǝrus kǝdǝ tǝ dǝm nye mǝn kartǝn dǝ mǝn Yahuda. Ti ni es tǝ pi mbap tǝp karǝm kǝdǝ a dǝm nye mǝn kartǝn dǝ munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni dagwa. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Ga Yakubu, na Bitǝrus, na Yohana, wi munju kan bi wur mbap kopi na mǝn kopi, nan wu shin kandatu Yam pim zo bar kǝdǝ a pi wazu kǝ zo shirǝm gǝso, arni wu nǝm mi, ami na Barnaba na mbatl nǝm. Na bi nǝm arni kup gǝmi pǝn den'e, ami na Barnabawo mi ri kar munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a, kan wi ngapo wu ri kar munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni gwa. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Argon tu wu yari katl gwa ni'e, ba mǝ mǝsǝnika na munju am ri wur kaar da gwa, tunkawo, bar tu ni nem tor mbatl dam kǝ a pi.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus matl Bitǝrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Nan Bitǝrus ɗir Antakiyawo, arni a matl ti ger na gere, domici tǝ pi argon tu ndari gwa da'a. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Argon tu piwo ar ni'e kapǝn dǝ Yakubu kar mbarǝm jen te Antakiyakawo, tǝ den ci fingal gip gal nǝm na mǝn kopi ju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da gwa. Ama nan munju kar wuri mbirawo, arni Bitǝrus za ci fingal na munju kan mǝn Yahudayi ni da gwa. Tǝ pini untu domici tǝ kum bǝrti kǝ munju kan ba wule ar nǝm dǝ sǝr mbarǝm gwa. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Untu ni es mǝn Yahuda ju kan mǝn kopi ni gwa pi shini kǝ ger tu wule kǝ Bitǝrus. Untu ni ma se Barnaba kan tǝ pi shini kǝ ger tu nan wuri. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Ama nan a shin wu pi bar gǝzǝn den tǝp kǝ ge shirǝm kǝ zo shirǝmi dawo, arni a wul Bitǝrus cina dǝ mbarǝm kup'e, &lt;&lt;Ki kan mǝn Yahuda ni, ama kǝ mani dǝmi wule muntu kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a. Imnu kǝ kem munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a wu kop kanda kǝ pitǝn kǝ mǝn Yahudawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝn Yahuda na munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a zam ɗǝltǝnwi tǝp kǝba ngǝshtǝn den Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Min mǝn Yahuda ni kǝba gǝri, ba'e munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a kan mǝn warwat pitǝn ni gwa. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Mǝ mom'e mbarǝm ba mani zami dǝmi dlat kar Yam gip kopi kulci kǝ Musa da'a, se de tǝp kǝba ngǝshtǝn gǝs den Yesu Almasihu. Mǝn ma mǝ ngǝsh mi den Yesu kǝdǝ mǝ zam dǝmi dlat kar Yami, ba'e tǝp kǝba kulci kǝ Musa da'a. Domici murgon ra kan baa zam dǝmi dlat kar Yam tǝp kǝba kulci kǝ Musa gwa da'a.<verse eid="GAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Mǝn den ndu'i mǝ zam dǝmi dlat gip Almasihu. Ama mǝn ni den pi warwat pitǝno, ar ba dǝm'e Almasihu ba kop kar kǝ warwat pitǝn ituwa? O'o, ko njem untuni da'a! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Ama ami ni a tlyam ami den tu'i argon tu kan far a yasi kawo, a dǝm mǝn nge kopi kulci kǝ Yam ituwi. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />A dǝm wule mǝshi mbarǝmwi, kan kulciyi'i na iko namǝn da'a. Kulciyi ngen den a mǝshi. Ama kǝkǝno a dǝm ni den bi pi argon tu Yam ba ndu gwa. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Arni wule ɓa'ǝm ni den kin na Almasihu. Kǝkǝno arni wule ami ni'i den dǝmi da'a, ama ami ni den dǝmi gip ngashi gam na Almasihu. Dǝmi kǝ dli tu kan ami denewo, dǝmi ni tǝp kǝba ngǝshtǝn den Nya Yami. Tǝ ndu'ǝm ni tǝp kǝba mǝshtǝn den bi gǝni. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Aa pali zo mbatl kǝ Yam zhe'e shirǝm da'a. Ama in mbarǝm baa mani zami dǝmi bat na warwat pitǝn cina dǝ Yam tǝp kǝba kulci kǝ Musawo, muntu gode'e mǝshtǝn kǝ Almasihu dǝm zhe'e shirǝm ituwi.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Zami dǝmi dlat tǝp kǝba ngǝshtǝn den Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Kǝn mǝn Galatiya kan gam gudlumi in kagwa, woni jili in kawe? Kǝn kan a yari in dyatlǝm den kandatu kan ɓa Yesu Almasihuka den kin gwa. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Argon tu a ndu a kum kar kǝno ar ni'e, kǝ nǝm ni Ruhu kǝ Yam den kopi kulci kǝ Musa na, ko tǝp kǝba ngǝshtǝn den shirǝm tu kan kǝ kum gwani? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Unun gudlumi in gamka untuwu? Kǝ la gǝsi gip Ruhu kǝ Yami, kǝkǝno kǝ ndu ni kǝ pa'i gip pitǝn kǝ dliya? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Patǝn gin naar den bar juwo katl ni ar ra ya? Katl ni da ca, <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Yam bi in Ruhu gǝsi, kan tǝ pi bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn gip kǝne. Ama tǝ pi ni untu den kǝ kop ni kulci kǝ Musa ya, ko tǝp kǝba ngǝshtǝn den shirǝm tu kǝ kum gwa ni? <verse eid="GAL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Untu ni Ibǝrahim pa'e, &lt;&lt;Tǝ ngǝsh ti den Yami, ar ni Yam ne ti tǝ dǝm mǝn pitǝn dlat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GAL 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Ra'untuwo, se kǝ mom ni den'e munju ngǝsh wur den Yesu gwa ni'e mimir kǝ Ibǝrahim. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Rǝshi shirǝm kǝ Yam yari terka'e, Yam ne dǝ munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a zam dǝmi mǝn pitǝn dlat cina da ti tǝp kǝba ngǝshtǝn den Yesu. Terka ni yari Ibǝrahim shirǝm mǝn tǝmtǝn den'e, &lt;&lt;Tǝp kar kini Yam baa la'i albarka mbarǝm kǝ ko gonge atli.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Ra untuwo, mǝn ngǝshtǝn den Yesu ra na albarka kǝ Yam nǝm na Ibǝrahim mǝn ngǝshtǝn den Yami.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Munju kup ba ne mbatl den kulci kǝ Musawo, bi nǝm wur ituwi. Ar ra na rǝshi gip shirǝm kǝ Yam'e, &lt;&lt;Bi nǝm kup muntu kan hol ci cina na kopi bar ju kup kan ra na rǝshi gip Tǝlankur kulci kǝ Musa gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Untuni ar ra, murgon ra kan baa mani dǝmi dlat cina dǝ Yam tǝp kǝba kopi kulci kǝ Musa da'a, domici ar ra na rǝshi'e, &lt;&lt;Muntu ra dlat tǝp kǝba ngǝshtǝn den Yam gwa ni baa zam rai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Kopi kulci kǝ Musawo ba'e ngǝshtǝn den Yam ni da'a. Kandatu kan rǝsh gwa ni'e, &lt;&lt;Muntu kan pi bar ju kup kan yari gip kulci kǝ Musawo, gipi ni ti dǝmi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Almasihu panse mi bi dǝ pi bi kǝ kulci kǝ Musa tuwi. Tǝ pini untu tǝp kǝba dǝmi muntu pi ti bi gwa den bi gǝmi. Ar ra na rǝshi'e, &lt;&lt;Kup muntu kan ɓa ti den kino, bi nǝm tiwi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Pansetǝn tu kan Almasihu pi miyi kem munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da'a kǝ zami albarka tu kan Yam pi Ibǝrahim gwa, kǝdǝ tǝp kǝba ngǝshtǝn den Yamo, mǝ zam Ruhu tu kan Yam wule ti bi gwa.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zami gaado tǝp kar gudlum shirǝmi ba'e tǝp kǝba Kulci kǝ Musa da'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Mir ɓyari, naa yari inni shirǝm den bar ju kǝ pi se na gǝni gwa. Mbarǝm rop ni gudlum shirǝm gip dlom gǝzǝno, to, mǝn pǝtlika ra da'a, eso mǝn ɓiti argon ra dene da'a, domici wu mo bi dene wi. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Yam yari ni Ibǝrahim gudlum shirǝm tu na gǝsgal gǝsi. Ba'e Shirǝm kǝ Yam wul ni'e, &lt;&lt;Gǝsgal gin&gt;&gt; da'a, muntu kan ar ba gode'e na womti ni gwa. O'o, ar wul ni'e &lt;&lt;Gǝsgal gi,&gt;&gt; mbarǝm nǝm ituwi, muntu kan'e Almasihu gwa. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Argon tu a yariwo ar ni'e, Yam tabbate gudlum shirǝm gǝs na Ibǝrahim. Kulci kǝ Musa tu kan ɗiri den kaar kǝ sheti ghon hauya kǝba lasi hauya nǝm na nǝm na kutlo (430) ar baa mani pali gudlum shirǝm tu kan Yam pi terka ar dǝm katl da'a. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Na dǝ wule gaadoyi baa zam ni tǝp kǝba kopi kulci kǝ Musawo, na ar baa zam tǝp kǝ ba gudlum shirǝm da'a, ama Yam bi ni Ibǝrahim gaadoyi tǝp kǝba gudlum shirǝmi.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />To unun kem kan ba bi kulci kǝ Musa rawu? Bi ni kǝdǝ mom argon tu ceni doka ba pi nupi ar ri gas tu kan gǝsgal kǝ Ibǝrahim baa cwat gwa, munju kan wi ni pi wur gudlum shirǝmi gwa. Ar tu ngap Kulci kǝ Musa tuwo mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam ni bi tǝp am dǝ mǝn dlǝri gip dlom kǝ Yam na mbarǝme. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Dlǝri gip dlomo, ar ba nǝra gip dlom kǝ mbarǝm rop, ama Yamo nǝm ni.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />O fawo, Kulci kǝ Musa ba pi ni gapa na gudlum shirǝm kǝ Yama? O'o, ko njem! E dǝ wule Kulciyi baa mani bi raiwo, muntu gode'e dǝmi dlat kǝ Yam baa zam tǝp kǝba kopi Kulciyi ituwi. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Ama shirǝm kǝ Yam yari'e atl kundǝrǝndlip ra na ɓali gip iko kǝ warwat pitǝne, kǝdǝ gudlum shirǝm tu kan pi gip ngǝshtǝn den Yesu Almasihuwo, dǝ bi munju kan nǝm shirǝmi gwa.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Kapǝn dǝ ngǝshtǝn den Yesu tu ɗiro, kulci kǝ Musa tu yo mi nǝka wule munju kan gip bom moni gwa, se gas tu kan ngǝshtǝn den Yesu cwat gwa. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Na untuni kulci kǝ Musa tu dǝmi mi bar kǝ gaatǝne ar ri surtǝn kǝ Almasihu, kǝdǝ tǝp kǝba ngǝshtǝn den Yesu tuwo mǝ zam dǝmi dlat cina kǝ Yami. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Ama kǝkǝn kan ngǝshtǝn den Yesu cwato, mǝ'i gǝs dǝ gaatǝn tu da'a.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dǝmi gǝmi mimir mǝn ci gaado gip Almasihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Gip Almasihu Yesuwo, kup gin mimir kǝ Yam ni tǝp kǝba ngǝshtǝn den Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Kup gin kan pi in batisma gip Almasihuwo, kǝ dǝm wule Almasihu ituwi. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Ra untuwo, mǝn Yahuda raka bom na munju kan mǝn Yahuda ni gwa da'a, ko dǝ zher nǝka bom na muntu kan zher ni da gwa, ko moni bom na mǝtli, ama nǝm ni kǝn ra gip Almasihu Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />In kǝn kǝ Almasihuno, to kǝn gǝsgal kǝ Ibǝrahim ni, mǝn zami gaado tǝp kǝba gudlum shirǝmi.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Argon tu a yariwo ar ni'e, wokoci tu mǝn zami gaadoyi i'nyayiwo, wule zher ni tǝra, kup na bar kupo gwas ni gwa. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Ar nǝm ti te yarka tǝ kopii mǝn ne ger den ti na kup bar gǝsi, ar ri nǝm wokoci tu bas ne gwa. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Untu ni, mǝn ma faro mǝn nǝra wule zher kǝ kulci kǝ duniya kan ra na iko gwa. Mǝn nǝra wule mimiri, kan wi ni'e ga babom gǝmi. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Ama nan wokoci tu Yam ne piwo, arni tǝ kar nya gǝs suri. Gǝri kǝ gǝr mǝtli. Gǝr mǝtli ni gǝr ti wokoci tu kulci kǝ Musa i'den mbap gwa. <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />Tǝ sur ni kǝ panse munju kan ra gǝs dǝ kulci kǝ Musa gwa, kǝdǝ mǝ zam dǝmi mimir kǝ Yami. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Kǝn mimir kǝ Yam ni. Yam kem dǝ Ruhu kǝ Nya gǝs dǝm su gip mbatl gǝmika. Ruhu tu ni ba wule, &lt;&lt;Abba, Bǝba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Ra untuwo, kǝ'i zheri da'a. Ama kǝkǝno kǝn mimir kǝ Yam ni. Dǝmi gin mimir kǝ Yamo, kǝn mǝn ci gaado gǝs ni.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus lir mǝn Galatiya ba wu za ge shirǝm kǝ zo shirǝmi da'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Far kan kǝ mom Yam dawo, kǝn zher ni kǝ bar ju kan Yam ni da gwa. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Ama kǝkǝno kǝ mom Yamwi, ko a wule, Yam mom kǝne. Kan unun kem kǝ pa pal den kulci kǝ duniya kǝn munju kan ra na ndǝrtǝn, ko na ampani da gwawu? Ar tu ma kǝ pa ndu kǝ dǝm zher gǝzǝnwi. <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Kǝ pi nyel kǝ pǝt jeni, na kyare, na wokoci, na sheti ghone. <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Ar ba ghunǝm kǝdǝ bar ju a kulci in kupo ar dǝmka katl.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Mir ɓyari, a lir kǝn den kǝ dǝm ni kandatu ami ra gwa. Kǝkǝno ami mǝn enci ni wule kandatu kǝn ra nari far gwa. Faro kǝ pim wani pitǝn gon da'a. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Kǝ mom'e a kum tǝmi kǝ dli gǝn da'a ni kem a ɗiri in wazu kǝ zo shirǝm tu. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Kup na ami ra hoyi da'a, kǝ pa kǝn namǝni, kǝ ngem da'a, kǝ dǝɗanyim da'a, ama kǝ nǝmǝn na am rop-rop wule nye mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami. Kǝ nǝmǝn wule Yesu Almasihu ni na gam gǝsi. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Akoni ghol mbatl tu kǝ pi far sabona mǝn gwa rawe? A mom'e dǝ wule mǝn pitǝnno na kǝ ɗǝli ger ginka kǝ bim wi. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Kǝkǝno a dǝmi in ni berǝm gapa nan a yari in ge shirǝmi gwaya?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Mǝn kulci mbarǝm shirǝm kǝ lar ja dǝdar ni den kǝne, ama gip tu gǝzǝn ra ngǝlan da'a. Argon tu wu ndu'o ar ni'e wu su gip dlom gǝmi nan kǝne, kǝdǝ mbatl gin pal den wuri. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Aan, ar mbun'e dǝ mbarǝm dǝdar naar den mbarǝme, in na ho mbatl ni gwa, ba'e se ami nǝra nan kǝn gwa da'a. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Mimir gǝni, wule kandatu gǝrmǝtli ba kum dli kǝba gǝri gwa, untuni a kum es den kǝne. Aa pi ta kumi untu, se kǝn ni kǝ dǝm wule Almasihu. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />E dǝ wule ami nǝra nan kǝn kǝkǝni, na aa mom kandatu aa shirǝm nan kǝn gwa. Ama kǝkǝno a mom imnu aa ne in am ra da'a.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hajara na Ishaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Yarim ni kǝn kan kǝ ndu'e kǝ dǝm gǝs dǝ Kulci kǝ Musa gwa, kǝ kum ni argon tu Kulciyi yari gwa da'aya? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Mǝ zhit gip Tǝlankur den'e Ibǝrahim ra na mir moni rop. Nyayi nǝmo nya gǝr zher tu ni, kan nǝmi ngapo nya gǝr gǝs kan zher ni dagwa. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Nya gǝr kǝ zheriwo gǝr tǝni tǝp kǝba argon tu mbarǝm ndu gwa. Ama nya gǝs gǝri kǝ gǝr tu kan zher ni dawo, gǝr tǝni den gudlum shirǝmi.<verse eid="GAL 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Kup muntu ra na nupi gon esi. Mǝtli rop juwo wini den dǝmi kǝ gudlum shirǝm rop kan Yam pi na mbarǝm gǝs gwa. Hajara ni den dǝmi kǝ gudlum shirǝm tu kan Yam bi Musa den tlǝndǝr Sinai gwa. Mǝn kopi gudlum shirǝmi muntuwo, wi nǝra wule zhere. Munju kup gǝr wur tǝp kar tiwo zher ni. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Mbǝli den muntuwo ar ni'e Hajara nǝra den dǝmi kǝ tlǝndǝr Sinai kan gip atl kǝ Arabiya gwa. Ti ni'e shishidǝr kǝ bǝn Urushalima kǝ kǝkǝni, domici ti na mimir gǝs kupo zher ni. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Ama Urushalima kǝ to yamkawo dǝmi kǝ enci ni, eso, ti ni'e nǝna gǝmi. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Ar ra na rǝshi'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">&lt;&lt;Pi ghol mbatli, ki njikǝne, ki kan kǝ gǝr dagwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Tli yar yam gip ghol mbatli, ki kan kǝ ɓom ci tu gǝri dagwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Domici gǝr mǝtli tu kan kos gǝs bali ti kaar</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">baa gǝr mimir na womti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">ar man gǝr mǝtli kan na kos gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Ama kǝn mir ɓyari, wule kandatu kan Ishaku ra, nya ni tǝp kǝ ba gudlum shirǝmo, kǝn ma untuni kǝn ra mimir kǝ gudlum shirǝm ni. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Ama wokoci tawo, nya tu kan gǝr ti tǝp kǝba argon tu mbarǝm ba ndu gwa pi gapa na nya tu kan gǝr ti tǝp kǝba ruhu gwa. Untuni ar ra kǝkǝni. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Shirǝm kǝ Yam wule, &lt;&lt;Kar gǝr zher tuka na nya gǝsi, domici nya zheri baa dǝm mǝn gaade bomi na nya kǝ muntu kan zher ni dagwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Ra untuwo, mir ɓyari, mǝn mimir kǝ gǝr zher ni da'a. Ama mǝn mimir kǝ muntu kan zher ni dagwa ni.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Enci gip Almasihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Almasihu ɗǝli mi ni kǝdǝ mǝ pini dǝmi kǝ enci. Ra untuwo, dlǝr ni hoyi, ba kǝ pa pal ni zher kǝ doka es da'a.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Kumǝn ni, ami Bulus, a yari in'e, kǝn ni kǝ za sǝr kǝn den bi kǝ dǝmi dlat na Yamo, Almasihu dǝm argon kar kǝn da'a ituwi. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Aa pa yari ine, kup muntu za dǝ sǝr tiwo, ar nǝm ti te yar ka tǝ kop kulci kǝ Musa kup ituwi. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Kǝn kan kǝ ndu'e kǝ dǝm dlat kar Yam tǝp kǝ ba kopi kulci kǝ Musawo, kǝ ɗǝli gam gin ka gip Almasihuwi, eso, kǝ nge zo mbatl kǝ Yam ituwi. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Ama miwo, tǝp kar iko kǝ Ruhu kǝ Yam ni mǝn den la'i mbatl naar den pǝt tu kan Yam nǝm mi'e dlat ni mǝnra kar ti domici mǝ ngǝshtǝn gǝmi den Almashu gwa. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Mǝn kan gip ngashi gam na Almasihuwo, dǝmi na sǝrtǝne ko nduɓuliwo argon ni da'a. Argon tu ba ndu'o ar ni'e ngǝshtǝn gǝmi den Almasihu kan ba shin tǝp kǝba ndu'i ɓyar gwa.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Nan kǝ ngǝsh kǝn den Almasihuwo, kǝn ra den kopi gǝs dlat. Woni kem kǝn kǝ za'i kopi ge shirǝm kawu? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Tle gam tu kan pi ino sur kar Yam kan lakǝn bi gwa ni ar ɗǝl da'a. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Wule kandatu ba wul ra gwa'e, &lt;&lt;Yisti njem ni ba kem bǝredi na naari kǝ tlitǝne.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />A tabbatewi den'e gip ngashi gam gǝmi kup na Almasihuwo, murgon ba'i jili inka da'a. Yam baa hukunte kup murgon tu kan baa ndu jili gin kagwa, ko ti woni. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Mir ɓyari, in wazu kǝ sǝrtǝn ni a'i den piwo, ununu kem mbarǝm den kumim dliwe? Na dǝ wule wazu kǝ sǝrtǝn ni a kulci mbarǝm gip wazu gǝn'e Yesu mǝsh kǝdǝ tǝ ɗǝli mi, na ar ba dǝmi murgon bar kǝ pati asǝm da'a. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Na a ndu'e mǝn tli in mbatl juwo, ar baa mani wu pali gam gǝzǝn wule wu'i ni moniyi da'a.<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Za ni dǝ Ruhu kǝ Yam kop nan kǝne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Mir ɓyari, Yam lakǝn ni bi kǝ zami enci, eso ba kǝ pǝn ni enci tu kǝ pini pitǝn kǝ dli da'a. Dǝ ndutǝn kǝ Yam kem kǝn kǝ ne am ya'ǝn ra. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Kulci'e &lt;&lt;Mǝ ndu berǝm dǝmi gǝmi wule kandatu mǝ ndu gam gǝmi.&gt;&gt; Kulci nǝm tu ni tla gam kǝ Kulci kǝ Musa Kup. <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Ama kǝn ni kǝ ci cina na dlan na ngǝngash ya'ǝn wule dabba kǝ gip lǝpo, ngup kǝnni, ba kǝ kem ni ya'ǝn kǝ ndetǝn da'a.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Argon tu a yariwo ar ni'e, za ni dǝ Ruhu kǝ Yam kop nan kǝne, ar ni baa kem kǝ nge pitǝn kǝ dli. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Domici dliwo ar ba nduni argon tu ba pi gapa na Ruhu gwa, eso Ruhu ba pi ni gapa na pitǝn kǝ dli. Gip dlan na ezǝn ni wura ko gigasi, ar ni kem ki pi argon tu kǝ ndu gwa da'a. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Ama wokoci tu Ruhu kǝ Yam ni ba kop nan kǝno, kulci kǝ Musa baa'i kop nan kǝn da'a.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Pitǝn kǝ dliwo ar ra na ghuuni da'a, muri na mǝtli na moni kari, pi bar kǝ dǝɗanye, na holi kumi shame, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />bote arjen ju kan Yam ni dagwa, na tle woti, na ngetǝne, na pi dlanye, na nge zami kǝ goni, na pi lo'e, na ndu'i gami, na tatli gami, na bǝtli asǝm gip barka, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />pi lo na zami kǝ ɓyari, na tle bar ju ba tlo mbarǝm gwa, na pi nyel kǝ warwat pitǝne, na kup nami warwat pitǝne. Aa dǝli in kǝme, ksandatu a dǝli fa gwa'e, kup mbarǝm mǝn pi bar juwo, wi zam tetǝn gip mulki kǝ Yam da'a.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Ama Ruhu kǝ Yam ni ba kop nan miwo ar ba kem mi kǝ pi ndutǝne, na pi ghol mbatli, na dǝmi zhǝlili, na te mbatl kaarka, na pi mbarǝm ho bari, na pitǝn dlat, na pi aminci, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />na ghalǝm mbatli, na nǝmi gami. Kulci gon ra kan nge pitǝni munju da'a. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Mbarǝm ju kan ba dǝm gip ngashi gam na Almasihu Yesuwo, wu ɓa dli gǝzǝnka den kin wi nan wu za dǝ pitǝn kǝ dli na kup arjen ju dli ba ndu gwa kop nan wur dagwa. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Tun kan Ruhu kǝ Yam ni kem mǝn ra na raiwo, na dǝ Ruhuyi kop nan mi gip dǝmi gǝmi kup. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Ba mǝ dǝm ni mǝn ɓe ngetle, ko mǝn tli ɓyar mbatli, ko mǝn pi lo na zami kǝ ɓyar da'a.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Gaa ni ya'ǝni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Mir ɓyar mǝn kopi, kǝn ni kǝ shin gon gin ni ndaka gip pi warwat pitǝno, kǝn kan Ruhu kǝ Yam ra gip kǝno, se kǝ pali tini ɗir den tǝp ɗem-ɗem. Ama ngup kǝn ni bǝse gip pali erǝm gin ɗir den tǝpo, kǝn ma kǝ ndaka gip godetǝni. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Neni am ya'ǝn ra gip pǝni giɓǝr gosgam gǝzǝni. Tǝp untu ni ki pi argon tu kan Almasihu kulci in kǝ pi gwa. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Kup murgon tu ba kum ti argon ni, ngapo ti argon ni da'a, tǝ seni gam gǝsi. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Ra untuwo, naa dǝ ko gonge mbarǝm gode mbap gǝs tǝ shin ko ɓe ngetl tu tǝ piwo den argon tu tǝ pi gwa ni. Ti cingǝr gam gǝs na murgon es da'a. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Ko gonge mbarǝm baa pǝn ni gos gam gǝsi.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Kup muntu kan kulci ti shirǝm kǝ Almasihuwo, naa tǝ tatl bar gǝs kup na muntu kan kulci ti gwa. <verse eid="GAL 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Ba kǝ seni gam gin da'a, ba mani lo'i Yam da'a. Kup argon tu mbarǝm nganiwo, arni ti rǝshi, <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />domici muntu kan ngani gip dli kǝ dǝ tǝ kumi gam gǝs tǝmtǝno, gip dli tuni ti zam ndetǝne. Ama muntu kan ngani gip Ruhuwo ti zam rai kan baa pa dagwa tǝp kar Ruhu. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Ra untuwo, ba ar banyi mi nǝka na ho pitǝn da'a, domici Yam baa bi mi ɓatltǝn kǝ mbap tu kan mǝ pi gwa, mǝn ni mǝ cen mbatlka dagwa. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Ra untuwo, mǝnni mǝ zam tǝpo se mǝ piini mbarǝm kup ho pitǝne, tun ba ma dǝ munju kan ɓyar ni gip ngǝshtǝn den Almasihu gwa.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirmitǝn kǝ paa'i bisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Shin ni ca kukutl-kukutl rǝshi tu kan a rǝshi in na am gǝn gwa!<verse eid="GAL 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Mǝn ndu'i'e wu zam cirtǝn kar mbarǝm ni ba ndu'e dǝ sǝrkǝne. Wu pini untu kǝdǝ wu kǝtǝri kumi dli tu kan wi tla in kum wur den wazu'e ɗǝltǝno tǝp kar Almasihu nan gǝs ni ba zam gwa. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Munju kan na sǝriwo, wi na gam gǝzǝn wu kop kulci kǝ Musa ndekes da'a. Ama wu ndu ni'e dǝ sǝr kǝne kǝdǝ wu ɓo ngetl den'e wi ni wu kem dǝ sǝrkǝne. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Ama ko njem aa ɓo ngetl na argon da'a, se de na mǝshtǝn kǝ Yesu domici gǝni. Na ho bi, tǝp kǝba mǝshtǝn gǝs den kin ni pitǝn kǝ duniya kǝn ina na ampani karǝm da'a, kan a'i na ampani gon gip pitǝn kǝ duniya da'a. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Na sǝri na muntu kan nduɓuli ni, ar ɓite argon da'a. Bar argon tu maniwo ar ni'e dǝmi pel mbarǝm kan Yam pali mi gwa. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Naa dǝ ghol mbatl na guna ger kǝ Yam dǝm na munju kup kan ba kop shirǝm tu gwa. Wi ni'e pel mbarǝm kǝ Yami.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Cina ɗewo ba dǝ murgon'i ghunǝm da'a, domici ami ra na dudur kǝ Yesu den dli gǝni.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Mir ɓyari, naa dǝ zo mbatl kǝ Babom gǝmi Yesu Almasihu dǝm nan kǝne. Ar dǝm untu.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>